OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers fading inland during
OL,7,Fthe evening, then becoming largely dry
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells and
OL,9,Fgenerally light winds. A notably
OL,10,Fcooler night than of late.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FSunny spells to start, but
OL,13,Fturning cloudier as outbreaks of
OL,14,Fshowery rain push southwards across
OL,15,Fthe region from late afternoon.
OL,16,FTemperatures below the seasonal
OL,17,Faverage and the cool breeze continues.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
